<title>NIGERIA: Port conditions update - Nigeria - Lloyds Shipping.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Nigeria - Lloyds Shipping.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>NIGERIA, Sept 30 - Public holiday Oct 1 for Independence Day. Ports will be working but at overtime rates and productivity anticipated to be low.</p>
<p>LAGOS - No berthing delays at general cargo berths.</p>
<p>PORT HARCOURT - No delays to any class of vessel. All crude terminals loading according to programme and no delays reported.</p>
</text>
